  "message": "Fix streaming event reads while preserving caller ownership of the transport.",
  "rationale": "A non-owning transport adapter prevents AsyncClient from closing the supplied transport, while the response context ensures stream cleanup on success and errors. Limits are validated before requesting, and HTTPX incrementally decompresses and decodes NDJSON before parsing stops at the requested count.",
